    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFour bedroomed semi-detached red bricked fronted family residence, located just off Edmondstown Road. Circa 2.5 kilometres from Rathfarnham Village, with living room, kitchen/dining area and downstairs w.c. & w.h.b. \n\nTo the front of the property there is off street parking, and the gardens to the rear are private. The area is mature and very well regarded with local shops within a five-minute stroll to include local shops at Taylor's Lane, with Nutgrove, Rathfarnham Shopping Centres & Dundrum Town Centre, all close by. \n\nThere is a selection of South Dublin's finest junior and senior schools within walking distance and the bus routes (15B, 74 & S8) close by provide easy access to the city centre and most third level education facilities. with the M50 network just minutes away. There are numerous leisure facilities nearby to include St. Enda's Park, Marley Park, Ballyboden St. Enda's playing fields and gym facilities, and many local golf clubs.\n \nGas fired central heating and double-glazed windows, and all carpets, drapes are included in the sale."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Hallway - \nCloakroom with w.c. & w.h.b.\n\nLiving Room - 3.39m x 5.54m\nWith bay window, marble fireplace with timber surround.\n\nKitchen - 3.37m x 3.77m\nWith a selection of fitted units & dishwasher\n\nDining Area - 2.15m x 3.77m\nFrench doors to private garden\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.99m x 3.88m\nWith built in sliderobes\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.99m x 3.83m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.64m x 2.91m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.41m x 2.86m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.99m x 1.61m\nWith w.c. & w.h.b. tiled walls, mains shower.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Gas Fired Central Heating</li><li> Double Glazed Windows</li><li> Timber T & G Floors to Ground Floor</li><li> Burglar Alarm</li><li> Carpets, Drapes & Blinds</li><li> Private Mature Rear Gardens circa 40 ft.</li><li> Garden Shed</li><li> Carpets & Drapes</li><li> Floor Area c. 96.22 sq.m. 1,036 sq.ft.</ul>"
      },
